  "name": "Legal Docs Pro",
  "description": "Your landlord just sent a 12-page lease renewal and you have no idea what half the clauses mean. Or you need an NDA for a freelancer by tomorrow and LegalZoom wants $59 for a template that doesn't know your business. Legal Docs Pro handles both sides: generate NDAs, contracts, privacy policies, and demand letters through natural conversation, or upload a contract you received and get every risky clause flagged with a plain-English explanation of what it actually means. It remembers your business details across sessions — company name, address, standard terms — so generating your next document takes seconds, not form fields.",
